#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_authentication.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_authentication.rst:8
msgid ""
"phpBB 3.1 introduced built-in authentication plugins which you can extend or"
" create your own."
msgstr ""
"phpBB 3.1 introducerede indbyggede autentificeringsplugins, som du kan "
"udvide, eller du kan oprette dine egne."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_authentication.rst:11
msgid "This tutorial explains:"
msgstr "Denne tutorial forklarer:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_authentication.rst:13
msgid "`Authentication Providers`_"
msgstr "`Autentificeringsudbydere`_"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_authentication.rst:14
